===Personal Logs===
====Day 1====
{{Transcript|text=
The Livingston kids came again today, still trying to find out what happened to their father while he was here. The doctors tell me they can't say anything to the family. Doctor-patient confidentiality, admin says. What a joke. 

Here's another joke, one I don't think anyone would laugh at: [[Livingston|Mr. Livingston]] actually died over six months ago and those records don't exist anymore, at least not on paper. Medical director made us 'lose' them. 

That was the whole point of their little 'digitize everything' campaign--better control over who sees what, a log of when they saw it, and the ability to make some parts of the record unreadable. But I know what happened. 

And I didn't lose shit. Hope those kids come back again. This time, I'll have what they're looking for.
}}

