====Larkin, M====
{{Transcript|text=
Patient: [[Melody Larkin|Larkin, M]]

Observations:

Patient shows signs of extreme stress and fatigue. Though the most common form of punishment now is exile, gun fights are still frequent and I've heard that the aftermath of raids by [[Raiders (Fallout 76)|those in the mountains]] are rather grisly.

I don't have anything I can give her, but I suggested that if she isn't willing to dip into the ration stockpile, the pharmacist on the south end of town might still be able to cook up something to help her get some sleep.
}}

====Terrence, L====
{{Transcript|text=
Patient: [[L. Terrence|Terrence, L]]

Observations:

Patient is experiencing a near complete psychological breakdown. He was barely able to answer his name.

Oh god, and his skin. The [[radiation]] he must have experienced to have that kind of damage, I don't even know how he is alive. They say that [[AVR Medical Center|AVR]] has hundreds of [[Ghoul|cases like his]] and worse. Some are still cognitive, but [[Feral ghoul|others]]... they don't know if it's radiation affecting the brain or psychological collapse due to horror.

I need a drink.
}}

===="Boone, D"====
{{Transcript|text=
Patient: "[[Daniel Boone (Fallout 76)|Boone, D]]"

Observations:

Interesting case.
Patient responds only to "Daniel Boone" and indeed seems to believe himself to be [[Daniel Boone|the historical figure]] by the same name. I'd heard that some of the hillfolk can end up a bit off after lack of socialization, but I'd not expected to see such a case.

Advised that he be sent to [[Fort Defiance|Allegheny]] rather than [[Eastern Regional Penitentiary|the Penitentiary]] for further observation.
}}

====Davis, P====
{{Transcript|text=
Patient: [[P. Davis|Davis, P]]

Observations:

Patient is a veteran, discharged from service after returning from [[Battle of Anchorage|Anchorage]].
Experienced severe shell shock set off by fireworks and had a dissociative episode during our session repeatedly saying, "It wasn't like the simulations."

Prescribed [[Day Tripper (Fallout 76)|Day Tripper]] as needed.
Informed [[West Virginia State Police|State Police]] for protective surveillance.
}}

